  "text": "Case note: CS(COMM) 120/2024\nClient: Swati Kamath (cardiologist, Pune)\nOpposing party: M/s Crescent Exports\nCourt: Bombay High Court, before Justice Sudhir Dhingra\nFiled on: 15 December 2024\nClaim amount: Rs 6,55,00,000\nIssue: geographical-indication dispute. The rival product uses the protected regional name on its label.\nAdvice given: Rely on the registered GI certificate and seek an injunction against the infringing label.\nOutcome: An injunction against the infringing label was granted.\nRecommended next step: Seek damages.\nWitness: Madhuri Ahuja",
